WEBVTT

00:02.379 --> 00:06.847
<i>Fuko enters Andy's memories using
the Artifact "Soul Caliber."</i>

00:07.056 --> 00:09.520
<i>She wakes up in 19th century United States.</i>

00:09.853 --> 00:15.197
<i>Fuko meets Andy and his buddies from this era,
and manages to pass the welcoming test.</i>

00:15.239 --> 00:18.746
<i>But because of an undertaking by scoundrels,
Andy's comrades are all murdered.</i>

00:18.871 --> 00:22.837
<i>Fuko decides to travel together
with Andy now that he lost his buddies.</i>

00:22.837 --> 00:30.018
<i>The long journey shares with Fuko the many encounters
and deaths Andy has experienced.</i>

00:30.520 --> 00:33.568
<i>One night, Andy asks Fuko what it means to die.</i>

00:34.193 --> 00:37.701
<i>Andy believes that one dies when
the brain stops thinking.</i>

00:37.701 --> 00:42.376
<i>But Fuko answers that death
is when nobody remembers you anymore.</i>

00:42.752 --> 00:47.052
<i>That answer gives Andy
a new interpretation of death.</i>

00:47.554 --> 00:51.019
<i>Suddenly, Fuko's body starts to become translucent
as if the time has come.</i>

00:51.185 --> 00:53.649
<i>She floats up and traverses through the times
of his memories yet again.</i>

00:53.733 --> 00:57.907
<i>April 15th, 1865. Washington, D.C.</i>

00:58.283 --> 01:01.039
<i>When Fuko comes to,
that was where she was standing.</i>

01:14.482 --> 01:16.904
Hey, Victor? So do you...

01:16.904 --> 01:18.323
...believe in reincarnation?

01:19.116 --> 01:19.785
Huh?

01:22.289 --> 01:24.836
Your soul lives for a long time...

01:24.836 --> 01:27.926
...and you get reborn in a new body when you die.

01:29.596 --> 01:33.979
I don't believe it.
Never believed in souls to begin with.

01:34.313 --> 01:36.944
People live because blood pumps to their brains.

01:37.236 --> 01:39.658
Why not? C'mon, believe!

01:39.658 --> 01:40.993
It's way better that way!

01:41.244 --> 01:42.204
Why's that?

01:42.204 --> 01:43.624
Why...?

01:43.999 --> 01:47.799
Well, because I'd get to see you again after I die!

01:48.634 --> 01:50.095
Don't you fret!

01:50.095 --> 01:52.725
Even if I do die one day
and wind up in a new body...

01:53.435 --> 01:55.188
I swear I'll never forget you.

02:15.353 --> 02:19.028
Yeah, I'm not gonna relinquish to anyone.

02:20.280 --> 02:22.493
Right, Juiz?

02:29.256 --> 02:30.760
1865

02:30.760 --> 02:32.262
APRIL 15TH

02:32.262 --> 02:33.933
WASHINGTON D.C.

04:11.753 --> 04:12.880
This is...?

04:13.381 --> 04:18.015
April 15th, 1865, in Washington D.C.

04:18.726 --> 04:19.894
Victor!

04:20.353 --> 04:23.736
They're my memories from this point on.
Get lost.

04:24.486 --> 04:27.869
These may belong to you...
but they're Andy's, too!

04:27.869 --> 04:31.083
I need to find out exactly what happened here...

04:32.127 --> 04:33.797
...why Andy was born!

04:34.339 --> 04:35.300
Unnecessary.

04:38.599 --> 04:40.770
I will kill you now.

04:41.353 --> 04:45.487
And when I do, you will warp
to the next chapter of my memories.

04:45.487 --> 04:49.495
And wherever you warp to,
I will kill you there again.

04:51.708 --> 04:56.258
This book has events logged until December 2020.

04:58.179 --> 05:02.563
I'm going to keep killing you until
I drive you to the final chapter.

05:03.105 --> 05:06.028
Then I'll crush and erase your soul while it's still in the book.

05:14.796 --> 05:16.883
What good does it do to kill me?

05:17.760 --> 05:23.354
I will make sure you never think about peeking
into my memories again.

05:23.647 --> 05:24.314
Moreover...

05:25.024 --> 05:28.281
Killing you means his psyche weakens.

05:28.699 --> 05:30.661
I'll use that opportunity to assume control.

05:31.328 --> 05:33.124
And I will return to being myself.

05:50.074 --> 05:55.043
You've got good spirit.
But there are things I must do as well.

05:55.920 --> 05:59.719
Curse your misfortune for ever meeting him, Unluck.

06:02.600 --> 06:05.689
At the least, you can run away
until the very end.

06:27.942 --> 06:30.029
Shin... juku...

06:33.662 --> 06:36.751
AUGUST 1, 2020

06:44.934 --> 06:46.938
<i>If what Victor said is true...</i>

06:47.355 --> 06:49.151
<i>...then this is my only chance!</i>

06:49.652 --> 06:51.614
<i>I can't die yet!</i>

06:51.906 --> 06:53.577
<i>I can't afford to die!</i>

06:56.123 --> 06:59.589
<i>I still haven't...
given you anything in return!</i>

07:00.465 --> 07:06.393
Andy!

07:08.899 --> 07:11.946
Too much trouble.
I'll kill all of you at once.

07:14.660 --> 07:15.913
Deadline!

07:39.502 --> 07:45.346
There. Unluck is dead. Missing today's encounter means
she'll never be able to meet him.

07:46.306 --> 07:47.935
Wait for me, Juiz.

07:47.935 --> 07:49.856
This time I will make sure to...

07:55.116 --> 07:56.285
Ten Twist.

07:58.372 --> 08:00.919
You fool.
This measly bullet can't-

08:04.217 --> 08:05.888
Vortex Bullet!

08:10.564 --> 08:12.776
Sick. Wicked sick!

08:15.031 --> 08:18.204
Wah! Andy!

08:19.247 --> 08:21.961
Well, look who turned into a big crybaby.

08:21.961 --> 08:23.506
I can't help it!

08:23.506 --> 08:26.721
I mean, I'm sorry for clinging to you like this!

08:26.721 --> 08:29.184
My Unluck...!

08:29.184 --> 08:32.440
All ya gotta do is not let go, yeah?
Just keep on clingin'!

08:32.983 --> 08:34.402
Aye!

08:36.950 --> 08:37.618
Now...

08:41.626 --> 08:47.303
So that's the Victor you talked about in the past...
my main personality, eh?

08:47.303 --> 08:47.972
Yup.

08:51.061 --> 08:55.236
Well, good to meet ya.
So why are you targeting Fuko?

08:55.236 --> 09:00.956
Because that girl is trying to sneak peeks into my past.
She seems quite eager to die.

09:01.749 --> 09:05.590
But this plays to my favor.
I have business on the outside.

09:05.590 --> 09:09.139
There's someone I need
to kill once I get you, you see.

09:10.099 --> 09:15.610
That girl isn't a resident of the book,
so killing her a few more times will extinguish her soul.

09:15.944 --> 09:20.746
Since your outside self is dependent on her,
I can use that opportunity to assume control.

09:21.204 --> 09:24.837
So I'm killing her as my ticket to the outside.

09:25.756 --> 09:29.471
I dunno what my outside self thinks of this girl.

09:29.471 --> 09:32.060
But I do know that my current self
has changed thanks to her.

09:32.519 --> 09:37.738
My takes on death, my hopes for the future...
and that's why I'm here.

09:38.489 --> 09:44.919
I'm deliverin' her to my future self. She's someone I need.
And I'll defend her if it kills me!

09:45.712 --> 09:48.133
I see.
Then, make an effort.

09:49.427 --> 09:50.096
Hang on tight!

09:50.096 --> 09:50.764
Got it!

09:53.352 --> 09:55.147
Deadvulcan!

10:07.798 --> 10:09.593
Repair Glide!

10:10.177 --> 10:11.681
Not bad, dead weight!

10:13.183 --> 10:16.356
<i>He's moving by acceleration
through repairing his coiled-up legs!</i>

10:17.150 --> 10:20.574
<i>It's dramatically smoother than
his repair-based movement in the past.</i>

10:25.040 --> 10:26.711
Deadblade!

10:31.094 --> 10:33.348
You've mastered solidifying
your blood, too, have you?

10:49.214 --> 10:52.386
<i>He's boosting his speed
by spraying blood from his joints.</i>

10:53.055 --> 10:55.602
<i>Meeting that girl
has improved him this much, I see.</i>

10:57.898 --> 10:58.775
<i>However...</i>

10:59.527 --> 11:01.531
<i>...they all lack proficiency.</i>

11:02.574 --> 11:05.120
Your blade isn't sharp enough, dense enough...

11:05.329 --> 11:06.081
...or powerful enough!

11:07.876 --> 11:08.920
Deadline!

11:14.682 --> 11:16.434
That was a waste of time.

11:24.910 --> 11:26.747
Deadroad!

11:29.043 --> 11:32.509
You've gotten far learning these tricks
in a mere 140 years' time.

11:33.010 --> 11:37.435
However, if that's the best you can get out
of both arms, this is all but over.

11:38.563 --> 11:39.230
Fuko!

11:39.230 --> 11:39.898
Yeah?

11:40.149 --> 11:41.359
Let go of me!

11:41.359 --> 11:44.867
Wha? No way!
If I let go, Andy, the Unluck will-

11:46.579 --> 11:49.000
Don't worry 'bout it!
Just trust me!

11:50.419 --> 11:52.758
Thanks to you, I've changed!

11:52.758 --> 11:57.183
You've shattered my views on life and death!

11:57.601 --> 12:01.399
So get on outta here,
and relay the message to my future self!

12:04.531 --> 12:08.665
I've got more than enough Unluck charged up!
Just leave the rest to me.

12:09.123 --> 12:11.169
I've got something I wanna try...

12:11.169 --> 12:11.837
...out?

12:14.467 --> 12:17.974
Let's do it... Unluck Bullet!

12:29.414 --> 12:30.709
Go get 'im, Andy!

12:30.917 --> 12:32.253
Yeah!

12:33.589 --> 12:38.223
<i>Unluck's special touch.
A large stroke of unluck is coming soon.</i>

12:38.558 --> 12:40.937
What a bother.
Should I blow it all away?

12:41.354 --> 12:42.148
Here goes.

12:46.281 --> 12:48.285
Unluck Bullet!

12:52.293 --> 12:58.472
What kind of stunt is this?
You're throwing the match just to shoot off some fingers?

13:01.645 --> 13:05.612
Still, they're just fingers.
They don't even pierce me.

13:05.779 --> 13:06.822
First.

13:09.828 --> 13:11.999
A gas explosion... a stroke of unluck?

13:12.500 --> 13:13.711
Why is it befalling me?

13:13.795 --> 13:16.466
I loaded my soul into my fingers!

13:19.013 --> 13:23.898
<i>Soul into his fingers?
So the unluck is residing in his fingers?</i>

13:23.981 --> 13:24.942
<i>Impossible!</i>

13:26.612 --> 13:29.827
<i>If I recall, a stroke of unluck
only affected his main body.</i>

13:30.995 --> 13:31.747
Second.

13:35.045 --> 13:36.799
It got Andy, too.

13:37.634 --> 13:40.472
I always started repairin' myself from my head.

13:40.807 --> 13:45.190
Cuz I figured ya need your brain to live...

13:45.692 --> 13:49.867
...and inability to think with it meant you were dead.

13:52.329 --> 13:54.417
A worthless perception.

13:55.294 --> 13:58.383
Yeah. That's why I changed.

13:58.926 --> 14:00.597
He repaired from his torso?

14:00.889 --> 14:02.308
Three Twist!

14:10.365 --> 14:15.125
When I met Fuko and journeyed with her...
I learned to stop lettin' logic dictate my life.

14:15.877 --> 14:20.177
Instead, I learned that I could live in this world
however I damn well please.

14:22.515 --> 14:24.728
Unluck dwells in the soul!

14:26.732 --> 14:32.827
And souls are what give people life!
That's the kinda world I believe in!

14:32.827 --> 14:38.589
So it doesn't matter how my body gets destroyed.
I can come back from anywhere!

14:45.645 --> 14:49.151
In the end, it's all a matter
of how we perceive the rules.

14:49.528 --> 14:54.913
So long as we believe in that concept,
our abilities'll develop as much as we want.

14:56.750 --> 14:59.005
And you've embodied that idea for me.

14:59.840 --> 15:03.681
So I've gotta thank you... God of War, Victhor.

15:07.731 --> 15:10.152
We can get even stronger.

15:11.947 --> 15:13.116
Third.

15:28.773 --> 15:29.941
Andy! Look at that!

15:30.735 --> 15:31.402
Yeah...

15:31.904 --> 15:33.364
Fourth.

15:34.283 --> 15:37.498
What now? No matter how much
we beat him, he'll be back-

15:37.498 --> 15:39.335
Yeah. That's true.

15:41.130 --> 15:41.799
Hm?

15:42.509 --> 15:45.013
That... was used when they caught you, Andy!

15:51.484 --> 15:54.115
So that's what you meant... Juiz?

15:57.371 --> 15:59.709
You're right. These two just might be...!

16:07.559 --> 16:14.321
I wouldn't be able to escape from that.
But he's a deviant. He'll bust out in due time.

16:15.157 --> 16:16.284
I see.

16:19.248 --> 16:20.208
Andy.

16:21.252 --> 16:25.845
I want to talk to... Mr. Victor.

16:25.845 --> 16:26.889
Why?

16:27.389 --> 16:30.478
I came here to learn more about you, Andy.

16:31.147 --> 16:35.948
And Victor is a part of you, right?
So I want to learn about him.

16:36.867 --> 16:41.417
Instead of sneaking peeks into his past,
I think it's better to chat with him.

16:41.543 --> 16:47.471
Okay. You heard it, Victor.
You can bust outta there anyway, can't ya?

16:59.621 --> 17:02.209
Shouldn't ya be used to seein' that by now?
Cut that out.

17:02.209 --> 17:05.090
I'm still not used to seeing it!
I'd like you to hold back at least a bit!

17:09.975 --> 17:10.893
So, um...

17:10.893 --> 17:12.104
What?

17:12.522 --> 17:15.318
What kind of relationship did you have with Ms. Juiz?

17:18.659 --> 17:22.124
<i>Juiz? Who's that?</i>

17:22.499 --> 17:24.044
I saw it!

17:28.219 --> 17:30.975
It was fragmented and not very clear, but still.

17:30.975 --> 17:35.526
I saw you and Ms. Juiz creating
the Union and working hard together.

17:38.323 --> 17:42.080
Apocalypse showing what he shouldn't have, huh?

17:42.707 --> 17:46.798
If those memories are true,
then why are you trying to interfere with our plans?

17:47.257 --> 17:50.263
Weren't you a member of the Roundtable yourself?

17:55.273 --> 17:57.570
You're just like Juiz.

17:57.820 --> 18:01.285
Like Ms. Juiz? What part of me?
No way! No how!

18:01.912 --> 18:05.795
You're heedless of danger,
and to help those you cherish...

18:05.795 --> 18:09.009
...you have a soul willing to bet it all for them.

18:12.265 --> 18:16.315
Looking at the two of you reminds me
of our past selves.

18:18.695 --> 18:20.741
At first, things went well.

18:21.242 --> 18:26.001
Step by step, we overcame the quests,
and got closer to clearing it all.

18:26.878 --> 18:29.968
<i>But I soon realized we couldn't win.</i>

18:31.262 --> 18:35.813
<i>Even after hundreds, thousands, tens of thousands,
even hundreds of millions of years passed...</i>

18:36.773 --> 18:39.278
<i>God's life was still out of our grasp.</i>

18:40.196 --> 18:41.867
We should have given up.

18:42.242 --> 18:43.787
No matter how long we continued...

18:44.329 --> 18:47.043
...we'd only be dancing in
the palm of God's hand.

18:47.920 --> 18:50.676
Still, she wouldn't give up.

18:52.805 --> 18:57.690
<i>She thought by making the best moves one by one,
she would reach God one day.</i>

18:59.067 --> 19:03.493
<i>So she boarded the Ark and Looped.
Over and over again.</i>

19:04.495 --> 19:08.127
<i>She's a fool...
She isn't immortal.</i>

19:09.506 --> 19:12.135
She should just die and save herself the trouble.

19:13.346 --> 19:17.062
That's why I've decided to kill her.

19:17.522 --> 19:19.274
But why do that...?

19:22.364 --> 19:26.998
What kind of man wants to see
the woman he loves suffering?

19:28.167 --> 19:29.461
Mr. Victor...

19:32.885 --> 19:37.895
<i>She won't give up until she dies.
Just like you right now.</i>

19:39.189 --> 19:42.237
But... I've changed my mind.

19:43.114 --> 19:47.748
That last stroke of unluck you both unleashed.
That was a sign of evolution.

19:48.542 --> 19:54.971
You learned that death wasn't my unluck,
and ended up summoning a capture tool.

19:55.556 --> 19:59.313
Previously, your unluck only dealt physical damage.

19:59.313 --> 20:02.360
But it transformed into personalized unluck
for the target.

20:02.360 --> 20:08.372
No doubt journeying with my counterpart yielded
a better understanding of your target.

20:10.586 --> 20:14.009
Which means, if you research and figure out God...

20:14.217 --> 20:17.057
...your unluck will reach God.

20:20.480 --> 20:22.860
Consciously control your unluck.

20:23.235 --> 20:26.743
Think of what death would be
to my counterpart the whole time through.

20:26.743 --> 20:31.503
W-Wait just a second!
What about 1865? What happened?

20:31.836 --> 20:35.678
That memory is of no use
now that you're stronger.

20:36.095 --> 20:38.224
Just keep marching forward.

20:39.184 --> 20:43.067
But if you must know, you can ask Juiz.

20:45.405 --> 20:48.035
By the way, do you know how I
can get out of this memory?

20:48.704 --> 20:52.920
Just kiss my counterpart there.
And I don't mean just a peck on the cheek.

20:53.129 --> 20:54.131
Wha?

21:08.117 --> 21:12.292
Hey, don't cry.
Just never forget and all that jazz, right?

21:12.752 --> 21:15.632
Y-Yeah, but...!

21:16.801 --> 21:19.766
I'm gonna be one with my future self!

21:19.766 --> 21:24.567
And I'll become even more handsome and woo you over!
So get yourself ready!

21:24.942 --> 21:27.030
Yeah! Can't wait!

21:31.288 --> 21:32.248
Later.

21:47.111 --> 21:48.990
<i>See you in the here and now.</i>

21:48.990 --> 21:54.000
TO BE CONTINUED

23:24.097 --> 23:24.974
PREVIEW

23:25.099 --> 23:28.565
<i>Throughout the long, long journey,
I continued to watch over their lives.</i>

23:28.940 --> 23:30.401
<i>Now is the time for me to pick up my pen.</i>

23:30.569 --> 23:32.280
<i>And fortune begins to take a turn.</i>

23:32.405 --> 23:36.998
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 23-A Story I Won't See Coming.</i>
A STORY I WON'T SEE COMING

23:37.040 --> 23:39.002
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
